-
-</BLOCKQUOTE>
-
-<P>
-Users of the GPU-enabled version should also cite the following paper:
-<BLOCKQUOTE>
-P. Giannozzi, O. Baseggio, P. Bonfà, D. Brunato, R. Car, I. Carnimeo,
